{"sourceOrderIndex":211,"stableId":"string:0cbd8a7a4f543344bb95659de87f67a5:119630935152910336","collection":"UI","key":"phone_sub_DaughtersFriend","nodeNames":[],"source":"Подруга девочки","target":"Teman perempuan si anak","targetFile":"Translations/id/ui-batch-005.json","targetFileSha256":"5dc196ef863a2068e92befb776952862e92d5332c4cb9466b6280b6bac4f097c","components":["context","glossary-referents","phone-contact-consumers","runtime-bindings","mandatory-regressions"],"deltaReasons":["explicitlyInvalidatedPrior"]}
{"sourceOrderIndex":8343,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455093428236","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Asking_3_003ccef","nodeNames":["Daughter_Asking_3"],"source":"Daughter: Когда взрослые зовут, её отпускают... А если я сама, то меня всегда ругают.","target":"Daughter: Kalau orang dewasa yang mengundang, dia diizinkan pergi... Tapi kalau aku yang mengajaknya, aku selalu dimarahi.","targetFile":"Translations/id/dialogue-batch-014.json","targetFileSha256":"c546ea8aacc1c27c9ca434f7d2dac32a24d9828642dad1205df18b9ad3ce0945","components":["context","mandatory-regressions"],"deltaReasons":["newDependency"]}
{"sourceOrderIndex":8344,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455093428235","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Asking_3_04109f4","nodeNames":["Daughter_Asking_3"],"source":"Daughter: И ещё... может, вы позовёте мою подружку в гости?..","target":"Daughter: Satu lagi... maukah Anda mengundang teman perempuanku untuk bermain di sini?..","targetFile":"Translations/id/dialogue-batch-014.json","targetFileSha256":"c546ea8aacc1c27c9ca434f7d2dac32a24d9828642dad1205df18b9ad3ce0945","components":["changed","context","repetitions","glossary-referents","mandatory-regressions"],"deltaReasons":["corrected","newDependency"]}
{"sourceOrderIndex":9898,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454548168705","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Asking_3_06917b3","nodeNames":["Daughter_Asking_3"],"source":"Возможно, папа не придёт за тобой. Я не знаю, что с ним","target":"Mungkin ayahmu tidak akan datang menjemputmu. Aku tidak tahu apa yang terjadi padanya","targetFile":"Translations/id/dialogue-batch-014.json","targetFileSha256":"c546ea8aacc1c27c9ca434f7d2dac32a24d9828642dad1205df18b9ad3ce0945","components":["context"],"deltaReasons":["newDependency"]}
{"sourceOrderIndex":9899,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454548168704","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Asking_3_07fcabd","nodeNames":["Daughter_Asking_3"],"source":"Я не знаю, что ты видела. Но, похоже, твой отец умер","target":"Aku tidak tahu apa yang kaulihat. Tapi sepertinya ayahmu sudah meninggal","targetFile":"Translations/id/dialogue-batch-014.json","targetFileSha256":"c546ea8aacc1c27c9ca434f7d2dac32a24d9828642dad1205df18b9ad3ce0945","components":["context","mandatory-regressions"],"deltaReasons":["newDependency"]}
{"sourceOrderIndex":9900,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454543974411","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Asking_3_0feebe4","nodeNames":["Daughter_Asking_3"],"source":"Daughter: У вас в комнате я видела телевизор. Можно там мультики смотреть?","target":"Daughter: Aku melihat televisi di kamar Anda. Boleh aku menonton kartun di sana?","targetFile":"Translations/id/dialogue-batch-014.json","targetFileSha256":"c546ea8aacc1c27c9ca434f7d2dac32a24d9828642dad1205df18b9ad3ce0945","components":["context","mandatory-regressions"],"deltaReasons":["newDependency"]}
{"sourceOrderIndex":9901,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454543974410","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Asking_3_0405ce8","nodeNames":["Daughter_Asking_3"],"source":"Daughter: Вы про что?","target":"Daughter: Apa maksud Anda?","targetFile":"Translations/id/dialogue-batch-014.json","targetFileSha256":"c546ea8aacc1c27c9ca434f7d2dac32a24d9828642dad1205df18b9ad3ce0945","components":["context","mandatory-regressions"],"deltaReasons":["newDependency"]}
{"sourceOrderIndex":11424,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937675","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_DontShoot_03b16f4","nodeNames":["Bald_Photo_DontShoot"],"source":"Bald: А ведь хорошая девчонка была. Симпатичная…","target":"Bald: Padahal dia gadis yang baik. Cantik pula…","targetFile":"Translations/id/dialogue-batch-120.json","targetFileSha256":"0c88f33479df340b6f38af8c779afcec5f5283e5481a59cb3605f3a741559e25","components":["context"],"deltaReasons":["newDependency"]}
{"sourceOrderIndex":11425,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937674","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_DontShoot_096467c","nodeNames":["Bald_Photo_DontShoot"],"source":"Bald: Это пиздец…","target":"Bald: Sialan, kacau sekali…","targetFile":"Translations/id/dialogue-batch-120.json","targetFileSha256":"0c88f33479df340b6f38af8c779afcec5f5283e5481a59cb3605f3a741559e25","components":["context"],"deltaReasons":["newDependency"]}
{"sourceOrderIndex":11426,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937673","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_DontShoot_0a5b3e8","nodeNames":["Bald_Photo_DontShoot"],"source":"Bald: Она бухая шла, оступилась, упала в речку и утонула.","target":"Bald: Dia berjalan dalam keadaan mabuk, salah langkah, jatuh ke sungai, lalu tenggelam.","targetFile":"Translations/id/dialogue-batch-120.json","targetFileSha256":"0c88f33479df340b6f38af8c779afcec5f5283e5481a59cb3605f3a741559e25","components":["context","mandatory-regressions"],"deltaReasons":["newDependency"]}
{"sourceOrderIndex":11427,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937672","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_DontShoot_0badd9a","nodeNames":["Bald_Photo_DontShoot"],"source":"Bald: И знаешь что?","target":"Bald: Dan kau tahu apa yang terjadi?","targetFile":"Translations/id/dialogue-batch-120.json","targetFileSha256":"0c88f33479df340b6f38af8c779afcec5f5283e5481a59cb3605f3a741559e25","components":["context"],"deltaReasons":["newDependency"]}
{"sourceOrderIndex":11428,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937671","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_DontShoot_09b12c5","nodeNames":["Bald_Photo_DontShoot"],"source":"Bald: Мы нашли её фотку, распечатали и развесили всюду объявления о том, что она пропала.","target":"Bald: Kami mencari fotonya, mencetaknya, lalu memasang pengumuman orang hilang di mana-mana.","targetFile":"Translations/id/dialogue-batch-120.json","targetFileSha256":"0c88f33479df340b6f38af8c779afcec5f5283e5481a59cb3605f3a741559e25","components":["context","mandatory-regressions"],"deltaReasons":["newDependency"]}
{"sourceOrderIndex":11429,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937670","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_DontShoot_03c6083","nodeNames":["Bald_Photo_DontShoot"],"source":"Bald: А потом через несколько дней узнали, что наша подруга, которая домой возвращалась, не дошла.","target":"Bald: Beberapa hari kemudian baru kami tahu teman perempuan kami yang pulang itu tak pernah sampai di rumah.","targetFile":"Translations/id/dialogue-batch-120.json","targetFileSha256":"0c88f33479df340b6f38af8c779afcec5f5283e5481a59cb3605f3a741559e25","components":["changed","context","repetitions","glossary-referents"],"deltaReasons":["corrected"]}
{"sourceOrderIndex":11430,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937669","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_DontShoot_0855c08","nodeNames":["Bald_Photo_DontShoot"],"source":"Bald: Мы как-то пьянствовали в очередной раз.","target":"Bald: Suatu kali kami mabuk-mabukan lagi.","targetFile":"Translations/id/dialogue-batch-120.json","targetFileSha256":"0c88f33479df340b6f38af8c779afcec5f5283e5481a59cb3605f3a741559e25","components":["context"],"deltaReasons":["newDependency"]}
